        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for North West Pastoral, North East Pastoral, West Coast, Flinders, Mid North, Yorke Peninsula and Mount Lofty Ranges forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures, showers and southwesterly winds are expected during Monday morning. Areas likely to be affected include the Flinders, Mid North and North East Pastoral forecast districts and parts of the Mount Lofty Ranges, West Coast, Yorke Peninsula and North West Pastoral forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
